The code does this:

    /* hard upper limit via nurse care: 25 * ulevel */
    if (u.uhpmax < 5 * u.ulevel + d(2 * u.ulevel, 10))
        u.uhpmax++;

So nurses can only increase your HP up to 25 times your
experience level.

